WEBVTT

NOTE A minute with Spencer Alexander. Captions for the home page film, timed from its own sound.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.710
There's something that I
think you need to know.

2
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.300
Life doesn't fit into
a neat little box,

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.650
but the legal profession tries to.

4
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.760
If you need help starting a business,

5
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.410
you go and see a commercial lawyer.

6
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:14.920
If you're going through a divorce,

7
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.590
you go and see a family lawyer.

8
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.080
Or if you need help drafting a will,

9
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.750
you go and see a wills
and estates lawyer.

10
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.240
But the reality is that these
three issues are not separate.

11
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.990
They're part of your life story.

12
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.150
And that is where I'm different
and where my firm is different.

13
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.900
We believe that we need to take
a tailored and bespoke approach

14
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.960
to every single client to ensure
that they are best protected

15
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.140
from anything that might happen.

16
00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:43.140
If you need that expert advice,

17
00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.520
and you want the right
person to speak to,

18
00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.390
don't hesitate to reach out today.
